+	  Enable this to support the PCIe function of the second combo PHY
+	  (COMB1) in the SERDES block of the Allwinner A733 SoC. The PHY
+	  carries one PCIe lane of the PCIe controller. USB3 on this PHY is
+	  not supported.
+
+	  If unsure and building for an A733, say M.
diff --git a/drivers/phy/allwinner/Makefile b/drivers/phy/allwinner/Makefile
